DTEND:20260914T104036Z
SUMMARY:The Moon occults Venus
DESCRIPTION:Venus disappears at 11:37:02 and reappears at 12:39:03 CEST\, s
 een from Hamburg\, DE.\nThe Moon is 2° up in the ESE · daylight\, Sun +3
 6°.\nTimes for the Moon's mean limb\, ±2 s.\nMap\, timings and the view 
 at the Moon's edge: https://occult.alokm.com/venus-2026-09-14?lat=53.5507&
 lon=9.9930
URL:https://occult.alokm.com/venus-2026-09-14?lat=53.5507&lon=9.9930
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
